WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,900
sit down and eat together

2
00:00:04,110 --> 00:00:05,110
thank you no need

3
00:00:05,390 --> 00:00:09,690
I won’t disturb you. Just eat. We’ll eat here while you watch from the side.

4
00:00:09,690 --> 00:00:11,890
How do you make me think about Chen Yundong?

5
00:00:12,370 --> 00:00:15,450
You either sit down and eat together or you go out

6
00:00:15,450 --> 00:00:16,810
Go out and find a place to eat by yourself

7
00:00:16,930 --> 00:00:17,890
Anyway, don't let me see you

8
00:00:18,370 --> 00:00:23,180
She's right, so don't bother me.

9
00:00:23,780 --> 00:00:24,980
sorry

10
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:28,270
She doesn't even look at me

11
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:31,220
Handsome guy, you don’t know me

12
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:34,930
Should we know each other?

13
00:00:34,930 --> 00:00:37,520
Why are you so serious?

14
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:44,070
If you look at it more clearly, you really don’t recognize me and think about it carefully.

15
00:00:44,510 --> 00:00:45,750
Nothing familiar at all

16
00:00:48,890 --> 00:00:50,170
Have we met somewhere before?

17
00:00:50,490 --> 00:00:51,690
Sorry, I have no impression

18
00:00:55,460 --> 00:00:57,260
Sister, although you are the national goddess

19
00:00:57,260 --> 00:00:59,060
But this nation does not include her

20
00:00:59,060 --> 00:01:01,300
Just give up on this idea and ask again a hundred times.

21
00:01:01,300 --> 00:01:06,230
She won’t know your handsome guy either

22
00:01:06,670 --> 00:01:07,870
Don't you usually watch TV?

23
00:01:10,030 --> 00:01:10,950
Does News Network count?

24
00:01:11,390 --> 00:01:16,390
I really don’t know him or did he do it on purpose?
